  "description": "The component CATALOG of a Rule pebble (a set of prescriptive constraints — the norms that MUST / SHOULD / MAY be followed when implementing or verifying): each component and WHAT belongs under it — pebble level (name, status Draft/Active/Inactive, description, references) and each rule item (statement, enforcement strict/recommended/optional, description, refs) — plus how rules are USED (referenced BY skills and agents ONLY; a rule references only knowledge), and every rule-related pebbles-cli command. A DEFINITION reference skills point at; method lives elsewhere.",
